  "businessLogic": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "title": "撈取客戶是否有裝置綁定紀錄",
        "details": "1.執行\nSELECT\nCustId\n,Udid\n,DeviceName\n,CreateDate\n, MidType\n, FidoFlag\n,TotpSecret\nFROM [DeviceBinding]\nWHERE\nDB.Udid = @Request.udid\nAND\n(@Request.custId IS NULL OR @Request.custId = '' OR DB.CustId = @Request.custId)\nORDER BY DB.createdts DESC\n1.1、依customerId （客戶ID）查詢該客戶所有已綁定的裝置\n2.執行\nSELECT\nUSERID\n,NEWDAFASTFLAG\nFROM [MMA].[USER] WHERE (CUSTID=@CUSTID) 查詢設置快登類型和UserID"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "title": "檢查手機號碼，若無則在跟主機要一次",
        "details": "無手機號碼→\n呼叫 CommonFunc.GetIC0001(freshFromIris=true) →\n從回傳的資料中讀取 key=\"SMS.1:1:1\" →\n拆分 \"-\" 取 sms[1]+sms[2] 組合為手機號碼→\n寫回 member.T24Sms\n可读取外援：TW T24 IRIS_OpenAPI_Summary_20231212 -> reference/global/raw/external-api/IRIS/TW T24 IRIS_OpenAPI_Summary_20231212.xlsx#sheetName=IRIS；ED0019_OpenAPI_spec_Enquiry_20260213 -> reference/global/raw/external-api/IRIS/ED0019_OpenAPI_spec_Enquiry_20260213.xlsx#sheetName=JSON Request-Response；EC0002_OpenAPI_spec_Enquiry_20260213 -> reference/global/raw/external-api/IRIS/EC0002_OpenAPI_spec_Enquiry_20260213.xlsx#sheetName=JSON Request-Response",
